  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water Development Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">El Wifagh is a cooperative with 78 members that improves livelihoods in the remote areas outside of Zouerate. Funds will be used to drill boreholes, construct a water tower, and install an irrigation system to improve its production system and living conditions.</narrative>
  </description>
